% Rx_ZrnGrRoundTrip.in = macos ZGD_test_files/tst_zrngr_roundtrip.in (db9236b), copied for the binding gates
% (mmacos tZrnGrRoundTrip, pymacos test_zrngr_roundtrip); GridFile is resolved from the cwd.
% tst_zrngr_roundtrip.in -- public gate for the NSCount SAVE round-trip
% fix (macos 2026-10-10, iosub.inc).  A Cassegrain whose primary is a
% single-member NON-SEQUENTIAL group (Element= NSReflector) carrying a
% ZrnGrData grid surface and declaring NSCount= 1 (the per-group hit
% budget).  Built from the public Rx_Cass_NS geometry; the grid is a flat
% 64x64 (tst_zrngr_grid.txt), so the surface equals its base conic and the
% trace is unchanged (nPass 32168).  GATE: load -> SAVE; the saved deck must
% contain NSCount= 1.  A PRE-FIX engine's SAVE DROPS NSCount (the key was
% never emitted by PrtSingleEltInfo), so the declared budget is lost on
% round-trip -- the must-fail leg.

        ChfRayDir=  0.0E+00  0.0E+00  1.0E+00
        ChfRayPos=  0.0E+00  0.0E+00  -5.0E+00
          zSource=1.0E+21

        BaseUnits=  m
        WaveUnits=  m

           IndRef=1.0E+00
           Extinc=0.0E+00
          Wavelen=1.0E-06
             Flux=1.0E+00

         Aperture=4.0E+00
         Obscratn=2.4E+00

         GridType=  Circular
         nGridpts=  256
            xGrid=  -1.0E+00  0.0E+00  0.0E+00
            yGrid=  0.0E+00  -1.0E+00  0.0E+00

